{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_spst_16-02",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "spst_16-02",
  "title": "Events of the Past",
  "storyCode": "EG-8",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d53ad77d13b097338193a3e6aa2693087dba3bf600b3c615fa509afd3ed476ab",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g5_deepmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Th-The guns have stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C-Can we go now? Not upwards, but down, before the bombs reach us—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get up, Yuri, and the rest of you. We need to find Rankin and the place he was talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know the bravest ones of us have all left with Rankin, to take the outpost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The bombing's stopped, and we don't know what's going on up there. The only way to find them is up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Either we save them, or, as Rankin said, remember them. Crawl, pull yourselves on with your pickaxes, if you can't walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But Rankin gave us his mining lamp—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you remember what he said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He... he didn't say anything..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's right. He didn't say anything. This is no different from the supplies that they left behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or we can choose to leave it here... as a reminder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, reminder. Leave the lamp in the mining cart, the one that we pushed all the way here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If anyone ever comes through..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I remember that you can write, Yuri."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've got some blank pages at the back of the logbook. We might as well not waste it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come here. I'll tell you what to write."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Worried Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If anyone comes, at least they'll know what happened here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>A mine, Northern Tundra, Ursus</><p=2>Winter, 1101</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sick Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sir, where... where are we going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sick Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't think the factory's this way—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shut up and keep walking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I said walk!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) The mines have stopped again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) So, nothing for the processing plants to work with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Where would they take us, if they don't need hands upstairs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fearful Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They dragged even the sickest ones out of their beds. Half the mine is here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fearful Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't want to keep walking. I don't want to die!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Shh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go through the forest, to the lake. That's where you'll meet your end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't even think..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "About running away."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Heavy military boots step on the snowy forest floor, moving forward, urging forward.\nThe miners are being escorted by far more than just a few men."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here. Stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's begin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone, on the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fearful Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1970_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, sir, please—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The saber cuts her throat, spilling hot blood on the soldier's armor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For the glory of Ursus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sick Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "<i>Bozhe moy</i>..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Proceed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "N-Next! Fill the gap! Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do we have to be treated like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shut up, you <i>uyobok</i>—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Were the Tsar's promises all a lie? Are our lives worth less than that of a burdenbeast?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Army Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1978_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the soldier is about to raise his hand again, the rumbling of the ground becomes perceptible.\nIt starts with a tiny crack, from the surface, from deep below, before snowballing quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground trembles, and the center of the lake collapses. The result of geological changes accumulated over time swallows the Infected on the ice, and their would-be executioners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Miner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1969_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The miner shakes off the stunned soldier and runs in the direction they came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Catastrophe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a Catastrophe!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldier, miner. Killer, victim. The vast Lake Angara accepts all and delivers all.\nBeneath the ice, an ancient nomadic city rises as the terrain changes, emerging through the sheet into the light of day.\nThe old-style buildings and the writhing faces of the dead look the same as they did when the city sank."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g10_tent_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>Reconstruction District, Far North, Ursus</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Northern Tundra'... 'Catastrophe'... 'Lake'..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All those words crammed into this tiny space, and I only recognize three."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll learn them in time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The lessons here are too basic for me. I'm planning to take over the work at the mines, which has been left untended for a while, and maybe learn a craft other than shoe repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once the curfew is lifted, I want to go to Deity Grypherburg."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't want to go to Grypherburg. I just want to learn to read. Three words a day makes twenty-one a week. In one month..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm glad to see your eagerness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you need help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These words still confuse me, <i>gospozha</i>."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're talking about these 'nouns', right? That's the lesson for this week—we're learning about nouns."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nouns, yes! Nouns. I think I'm starting to be able to tell them apart, but I can't quite get their meanings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Diligent Miner",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's this... uh... 'Shimok'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's 'Simonch'. It's a name, like the name 'Angara', the lake, or your name, 'Vova'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Koshelna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the name of a nomadic city."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "66_g5_deepmine"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The youth bids his classmate farewell and goes into the mines, ready to get to work.\nMine tunnels left untended gradually wear down and eventually collapse. He will not allow it to happen, as long as he is still here.\nThe young man raises his mining lamp and begins his rounds, examining all the rail, until he finds a mining cart at one of the forks that does not belong to this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A mining lamp?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And a letter—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This was once the place of a struggle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn it. The people who proposed connecting the mining districts were here! They wanted to occupy that garrisoned outpost!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I knew the story was true..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoever's lamp this was, it's in good condition. Maybe a little dusty, but it still works..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe I should take it to Grypherburg—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And show everyone..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Craftsman",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This lamp without a name, and those people without names."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
